database_schema:
MongoDB Document Model: {
  _id: ObjectId,
  customerId: String,
  name: String,
  email: String,
  country: String,
  countrySpecificFields: {
    jp_myNumber: String?,
    eu_vatId: String?,
    us_ssn: String?,
    otherFields: Map<String, Any>
  },
  createdAt: Date,
  updatedAt: Date
}
Indexes:
  1. { customerId: 1 }
  2. { email: 1 }
  3. { country: 1 }
  4. { countrySpecificFields.eu_vatId: 1 }
PostgreSQL schema remains unchanged; read/write operations occur via existing ORM models during dual-write.
